---
source: tests/conformance/query_v1_matrix.rs
assertion: ee.query.v1 query-file validation errors return stable machine-readable envelopes
schema:
  query_file: ee.query.v1
  envelope: ee.error.v2
  parser: src/cli/mod.rs::parse_query_document
  loader: src/cli/mod.rs::load_query_file
contracts:
  - Missing file at --query-file path returns MissingFile with a structured error envelope
  - Malformed JSON body returns MalformedJson with the JSON parse position and a fix hint
  - Unknown or missing schema version returns InvalidFile/InvalidVersion before any further parsing
  - Empty or whitespace-only query text is rejected, never silently coerced to a wildcard
  - Future timestamps in time.* / asOf produce structured rejections rather than overflow
  - budget.maxTokens=0 (and other zero budgets) reject the request before any pack work
  - Wrong type for tags (array of non-strings) is rejected with a stable machine error path
  - Wrong type for tags (string instead of object) is rejected with a distinct stable error
  - Unknown top-level fields surface as low-severity `query_unknown_field` degradations, not silent drops
  - Unknown graph subfields return MalformedJson with field-path provenance
  - Symlink and parent-dir traversal paths to --query-file are rejected as UnsafePath
  - Files exceeding QUERY_FILE_MAX_BYTES are rejected with InvalidFile and a size-hint repair
evidence:
  - tests/conformance/query_v1_matrix.rs::matrix_error_malformed_json
  - tests/conformance/query_v1_matrix.rs::matrix_error_unknown_version
  - tests/conformance/query_v1_matrix.rs::matrix_error_empty_query_text
  - tests/conformance/query_v1_matrix.rs::matrix_error_whitespace_query_text
  - tests/conformance/query_v1_matrix.rs::matrix_error_invalid_timestamp_format
  - tests/conformance/query_v1_matrix.rs::matrix_error_zero_budget_max_tokens
  - tests/conformance/query_v1_matrix.rs::matrix_error_query_file_not_found
  - tests/conformance/query_v1_matrix.rs::matrix_error_tags_wrong_type_array
  - tests/conformance/query_v1_matrix.rs::matrix_error_tags_wrong_type_string
  - tests/e2e_query_file_validation.rs::query_file_with_invalid_tags_array_returns_error
  - tests/e2e_query_file_validation.rs::query_file_with_unknown_graph_field_returns_malformed_error
  - tests/e2e_query_file_validation.rs::query_file_with_malformed_json_returns_error
  - tests/e2e_query_file_validation.rs::query_file_missing_returns_error
  - tests/property_eql_query_parsing.rs::parse_eql_query_never_panics_on_arbitrary_json
  - tests/property_eql_query_parsing.rs::parse_eql_query_never_panics_on_known_key_garbage
  - tests/property_eql_query_parsing.rs::parse_eql_query_rejects_blank_query_text
  - tests/property_eql_query_parsing.rs::parse_eql_query_rejects_zero_limit
